<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Aye pimp! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou can recruit homies off the street\fwith Hood Balls.\rWatch how I do it! Follow me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ayo! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou can recruit homies off the street\fwith Hood Balls.\rWatch how I do it! Follow me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Just like that!\r...\nHuh? Too fast for you?\rAight, one more time. This way!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">See? Easy!\rIt’s better to rough ’em up\nfirst, then hit ’em with the pitch,\for knock ’em out cold or somethin’.\rTry all kinda stuff and\nsee what works. Be creative.\rHere, take these. Stay dangerous!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">See? Easy!\rIt’s better to rough ’em up\nfirst, then hit ’em with the pitch,\for knock ’em out cold or somethin’.\rTry all kinda stuff and\nsee what works. Be creative.\rHere, take these. Stay dangerous!\r</language>
	</row>
