	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Bet! I’m out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Bet! I’m out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, how your homies doin’?\rIf they weak and ain’t ready to\nscrap, stay outta the tall grass.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You see them ledges?\nScary to jump off, ngl.\rBut you can get back to New Bark\nwithout goin’ through the grass.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I needed a break, so I\nsaved my progress. Self care.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ on homies that\nonly come out in the day.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ on homies that\nonly come out at night. Like me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ on homies that\nonly come out in the mornin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 29\nWest to Cherrygrove City</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 29\nEast to New Bark Town</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0373_R29_00017" index="17">
